##
## Upstream tests to disable
##
## When adding a new filter to this list, please include a short description of
## why the filter is required and create an associated tracking issue.
##

# GoogleGroupsManagerFactory is permanently disabled in chromium_src
# (BuildServiceInstanceForBrowserContext/RegisterProfilePrefs are no-ops), so
# the real GoogleGroupsManager these fixtures construct via a custom
# TestingFactory crashes in every test (CHECK failed: unregistered pref
# sync.dogfood_groups) during TestingProfile::Init.
-AiOverlayDialogPageHandlerGeminiEnterpriseTest.*
-AiOverlayDialogPageHandlerTest.*
-GeicEnablingTest.GoogleGroupsFilterEnablesOnlyMatchingProfile

# Tests assume kPdfInfoBar is enabled; we disable it.
-PdfInfoBarControllerTest.*

# Test assumes kGeic is enabled by default; we disable it.
-GeicEnablingTest.DefaultState

# Brave doesn't ship Glic: `GlicGlobalEnabling::IsEnabledByGlobalCriteria()`
# always fails, so these tests, which expect Glic enabled once `kGlic` is,
# invoke it from Skills, or set up a `GlicUnitTestEnvironment` (which crashes
# signing in for Glic), fail.
-*Glic*
-SkillsUiTabControllerV2Test.SendPrompt_*Conversation*
-TabStripActionContainerActivityHubLegacyIconsTest.*
-TabStripActionContainerTest.LegacySecondaryButtonDefaultIconAndTooltip
-TabUnderlineControllerTest.*

# These tests fail because we disable the kPersonalContext feature, which
