# These tests fail because we don't use kChromeUINewTabPageThirdPartyURL. With
# a default search engine other than Google, search::GetNewTabPageURL() isn't
# chrome://new-tab-page either, so NtpRendererKeepAlive never sees the WebUI NTP
# as active.
-All/PermissionSubscriptionGeolocationTest.SubscribeUnsubscribeForNewTabPage/*
